.SH EXAMPLES
One vulnerable\->fixed pair per ecosystem (Python).
.SS Python
\fIVulnerable:\fR
.RS
.EX
subprocess.run(f"git log {ref}", shell=True)   # argument/flag injection
.EE
.RE
\fIFixed:\fR
.RS
.EX
subprocess.run(["git", "log", "--", ref])       # -- ends option parsing
.EE
.RE
